# Everything in this repo is LF, on every platform.
#
# service-fleet/ is the folder the app installs and it is hashed byte for byte
# (server/services/modules-host.ts in Bored Manager), so a CRLF checkout would
# hash differently from the release zip and the host would call the module
# 'modified' and refuse to activate it. shared/ and vendor/ are copies of app
# files whose hashes sdk.lock.json records, which has the same requirement.
* text=auto eol=lf
